  "session_header": "[SESSION_HEADER]\nTimestamp: 1492 DR, Hammer 1, 08:15:00\nLocation: Sealed Vault Chamber\nStatus: Lvl 4 Wizard | HP: 24/24 | XP: 6900/14000 | Gold: 10gp\nConditions: Normal | Exhaustion: 0 | Inspiration: No",
